---
import SiteLayout from "~/layouts/site-layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "~/components/site-header.astro";
import { loadDecks } from "~/common/load-decks";

const decks = loadDecks();
const master = decks.find((deck) => deck.id === "master")!;
const modules = decks.filter((deck) => deck.id !== "master");
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Aceh Manifesto — the broadest autonomy in Indonesia, the deepest poverty in Sumatra"
  description="Twenty-one years after Helsinki the money arrived and the powers did not. A source-linked argument for production autonomy in Aceh, and the evidence behind it."
  canonical="/"
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main class="manifesto">
    <p class="kicker">ACEH 2045 · A PRODUCTION-AUTONOMY AGENDA</p>
    <h1>Aceh has the broadest autonomy in Indonesia and the deepest poverty in Sumatra.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Twenty-one years after Helsinki, the money arrived and the powers did not. This is the argument for
      fixing that — and the evidence behind it, with a source and a date on every number.
    </p>

    <section class="stats" aria-label="Key figures">
      <div><b>2.97%</b><span>GRDP growth, 2025</span></div>
      <div><b>12.34%</b><span>Poverty, March 2026 — highest in Sumatra</span></div>
      <div><b>Rp104T</b><span>Otsus transfers received, 2008–2024</span></div>
      <div><b>2027</b><span>Year the special-autonomy fund ends</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>The settlement</h2>
      <p>
        On 15 August 2005, seventy-one clauses ended a thirty-year war. Law 11/2006 turned them into
        Indonesian statute and handed Aceh a package no other province holds: its own political parties,
        qanun carrying the force of Islamic law, joint management of oil and gas, seventy per cent of
        hydrocarbon revenue, a free port at Sabang, a special economic zone at Arun, and the right to deal
        with institutions abroad.
      </p>

      <h2>The result</h2>
      <p>
        Aceh received Rp104 trillion in special-autonomy transfers between 2008 and 2024. Its 2026 budget
        spends Rp576 billion on capital — about five per cent of everything it spends. Coal is sixty to
        seventy per cent of what it exports. Investment realisation was Rp9 trillion; West Java's was
        Rp297 trillion. Sixty-four per cent of Acehnese work informally.
      </p>

      <h2>The diagnosis</h2>
      <p>
        The usual explanation is that Aceh needs more autonomy. The register says otherwise. Thirteen
        mandates were written into the law and never executed. Land administration was due to transfer by
        2008; the national land office still runs it in 2026. Every commercial port and airport is operated
        by a state company under a clause that promised joint management. The zakat tax credit has waited
        twenty years for one government regulation. Article 166's fiscal facilities have never produced a
        single instrument. Aceh's oil and gas authority stops at twelve nautical miles — and every major
        Andaman discovery lies beyond that line.
      </p>

      <h2>The deadline</h2>
      <p>
        The special-autonomy fund ends in 2027. Parliament is redrafting the law now, with a 2.5 per cent
        share on the table. Whatever the number, the transfer era is closing — and nothing in eighteen years
        suggests another transfer, on its own, would change the outcome.
      </p>

      <h2>The argument</h2>
      <p>
        Execute what Aceh already holds. Build two corridors: Arun–Lhokseumawe for energy-linked industry,
        Sabang–Banda Aceh for maritime, tourism and digital. Put professional institutions behind them — an
        investment agency answerable for outcomes, a development corporation of single-mandate subsidiaries,
        a delivery unit publishing a register of every unexecuted article and who owns it. Then ask Jakarta
        for a short, precise list: consent as Helsinki promised, resources beyond twelve miles, a free-port
        chapter, a rolling devolution mechanism — each paired with a precedent Indonesia or its neighbours
        have already granted.
      </p>
      <p class="claim">
        Autonomy should be measured in household prosperity, not in the volume of transfers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="doors" aria-label="Read the evidence">
      <a class="door primary" href={`${master.href}/`}>
        <span class="door-kicker">{master.kicker}</span>
        <span class="door-title">{master.title}</span>
        <span class="door-desc">{master.description}</span>
        <span class="door-meta">{master.slides.length} slides →</span>
      </a>
      <div class="door-grid">
        {
          modules.map((deck) => (
            <a class="door" href={`${deck.href}/`}>
              <span class="door-kicker">{deck.kicker}</span>
              <span class="door-title">{deck.title}</span>
              <span class="door-desc">{deck.description}</span>
              <span class="door-meta">{deck.slides.length} slides →</span>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="foot">
      <span>Research cutoff 30 August 2026. Every figure carries a publisher and a date.</span>
      <a href="/about/">Method and licence →</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 96px;
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-source);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--color-red);
    margin: 0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 68px;
    line-height: 72px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 16px 0 24px;
    max-width: 15ch;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 33px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 0 56px;
  }
  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .stats div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    width: 220px;
  }
  .stats b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 48px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }
  .stats div:first-child b {
    color: var(--color-red);
  }
  .stats span {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 20px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    margin: 40px 0 10px;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 31px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .claim {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px !important;
    line-height: 36px !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-red);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 32px !important;
  }
  .doors {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 72px 0 48px;
  }
  .door-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .door {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .door:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .door.primary {
    border-color: var(--color-ink);
    background: var(--color-tint);
  }
  .door-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--color-red);
  }
  .door-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }
  .door-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 22px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .door-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-source);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .foot {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-source);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .foot a {
    color: var(--color-red);
  }
</style>
